\]


all gauge and gravitational anomalies cancel:
\begin{align}
[SU(3)]^2 U(1) &= 0, \\
[SU(2)]^2 U(1) &= 0, \\
[U(1)]^3 &= 0, \\
\text{gravitational}^2 U(1) &= 0.
\end{align}
\end{theorem}

\begin{proof}[Sketch]
Compute anomaly coefficients by summing hypercharge contributions over
left-handed fermions. For example,


\[
